<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- Gofa Full Bible Latin Version Final</book>
  <para style="h">2 Taselonqe Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Taselonqe Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Tase</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Taselonqe</para>
  <para style="mt1">Phawuloosi Teselonqe Asaas</para>
  <para style="mt2">Xaafida Nam7antho Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Kiristoosa nam7antho yuussaa bolla dendida oyshoy palama medhida gisho, Teselonqe woosa keethan metoy dari dari bis. Phawuloosi Teselonqe asaas xaafida nam7antho kiitay, “Godaa yuussaa gallasay matis” giya ammano timirtiya bolla minthidi odees. Phawuloosi odishe, Kiristoosi yaanape sinthe, “Geella ura” geetetiya “Kiristoosa ixeysi kaalethin, ha alamiya bolla iitatethinne geellatethi darishe baana” yaagidi enta ammanuwa suurisees.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hawaarey, metoynne waayey darikoka, enti banta ammanuwan minnanaada, banta duussas koshshiyaba demmanaw minnidi oothana melanne lo77o ooso oothanaw guye goonna mela enta minthidi zorees.</para>
  <para style="iot">Maxaafa Ayfe qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">Gelo qofa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TH 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Godaa yuussanne suure pirda <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TH 1:3-12">1:3-12</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Goday yaana <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TH 2:1-12">2:1-12</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ammanetada de7a <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TH 2:13-17">2:13-17</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Woossite; minnidi oothite <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TH 3:1-15">3:1-15</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Sarothonne anjo <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TH 3:16-18">3:16-18</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1"/>Phawuloosi, Sillaaseynne Ximotiyoosi Teselonqe woosa keethan de7iya, Xoossaa Aawabanne Godaa Yesuus Kiristoosaba gidida asaas xaafetida kiita.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:1">Hawa 17:1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="2TH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2"/>Xoossaa nu Aawapenne Godaa Yesuus Kiristoosape aadho keehatethaynne sarotethay hintew gido.<verse eid="2TH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristoosi Simmiya Wode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3"/>Nu ishato, hinte ammanoynne hinte issoy issuwanne harata siiqiya siiqoy daro dicciya gisho, nuuni hessas Xoossaa ubba wode galatanaw bessees. <verse eid="2TH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4"/>Hintena gakida goodaninne waaye ubban gencaninne ammanon minnidi eqida gisho, nuuni nu huuphen Xoossaa woosa keethatan hintebaa markatishe hintenan ceeqetoos.<verse eid="2TH 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5"/>Hinte iya gisho gidi meto ekiya Xoossaa kawotethaas besseyisata gididi taybetana mela Xoossaa xillo pirdaas haysi malla. <verse eid="2TH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6"/>Xoossay tuma pirdaa pirdana. Xoossay hintena waayseysata bolla waaye ehana. <verse eid="2TH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7"/>Goday Yesuusi ba wolqaama kiitanchotara, tama lacora salope yaa wode waayetiya hintenanne nuna shempisana. <verse eid="2TH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8"/>Qassi Xoossay bana eronnaysatanne nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristoosa Wongelas kiitetonayisata pirdana. <verse eid="2TH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9"/>Enti Godaa sinthafenne iya bonchuwa wolqaafe shaaketidi merinaa dhayuwan pirdetana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:10">Isa 2:10</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="2TH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10"/>He gallas, I ba geeshsha asaaninne bana ammaniya ubban bonchetanawunne sabetanaw yaa wode nu hintew odida kiitaa hinte ammanida gisho, hinte iya boncheyisata giddoninne sabbeyisata giddon daana.<verse eid="2TH 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11"/>Nuuni hintew ubba wode Xoossaa woossey hessasa. Nu Xoossay hintena xeegida de7uwas besseyisata gididi taybetana mela nuuni woossoos. Hinte lo77oba oothanaw amotiya amuwanne hinte ammano oosuwa I ba wolqan polo. <verse eid="2TH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12"/>Hessan nu Xoossaanne nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristoosa aadho keehatethan, Godaa Yesuusa sunthaa hinte bonchana; hintenaka I bonchana.<verse eid="2TH 1:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Geella Ura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1"/>Nu ishato, nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristoosa yuussabaanne nu iyara gahetanaw shiiqanabas nu hintena woossoos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:10">Isa 2:10</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="2TH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2"/>Tinbiten woyko hara asape si7ida qaalan woyko nuupe ekida kiittada oothidi, “Godaa gallasay gakis” gidi hinte wozanay dagammofonne waabaqopo. <verse eid="2TH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3"/>Hintena oonika ay ogenka balethofo. Kasetidi geellatethay qonconnanne dhayoy bessiya geella uray yoonna de7ishin, Godaa gallasay gakenna. <verse eid="2TH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4"/>Asi goyinniyabanne xoossayaba ubbaa I ixananne bana dhoqu oothana. Hari attoshin, Xoossa keethi geli uttidi, “Taani Xoosse” gaana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 11:36">Daane 11:36</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 28:2">Hiz 28:2</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="2TH 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5"/>Taani hintera de7ashe hintew odidaysa akeekeketii? <verse eid="2TH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6"/>I ba gallasan yaanape attishin, ha77i yaanaysa aybi iya teqiyako hinte ereeta.<verse eid="2TH 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7"/>Asaas qonciboonna geellatetha xuura wolqay ha77ika oothees, shin ha77i iya teqeysi de7ees. Iya teqeysi ogepe kichana gakanaw I qoncenna. <verse eid="2TH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8"/>Hessafe guye, geella uray qoncana, shin Godaa Yesuusi ba doonape keyiya shempuwan, ba boncho yuussan iya wodhana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:4">Isa 11:4</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="2TH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9"/>Geella uray, Xalahe wolqan yidi wordo malaatatanne malaalsiyabata oothana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:24">Maato 24:24</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="2TH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10"/>Hessadaka, dhayos de7iya asata dumma dumma cimmiya iita ooson balethana. Enti dhayiday ashshiya tumaa dosidi ekonna ixida gishosa. <verse eid="2TH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11"/>Hessa gisho, enti wordo gidiyaba ammanana mela Xoossay wolqaama baleso enta bolla yeddana. <verse eid="2TH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12"/>Hessika, tumaa ammanonna asati, nagara ooson ufayteysati ubbay pirdetana melasa.<verse eid="2TH 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ammanthiya Asi Gida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13"/>Goday dosiya nu ishato, nuuni Xoossaa hinte gisho, ubba wode galatanaw bessees. Hinte attana mela Xoossay Geeshsha Ayyaana wolqan hintena geeshshidaysanne hinteka tumaa ammanidaysan I hintena bayrada dooris. <verse eid="2TH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14"/>Xoossay, nu hintew odida Wongela baggara hintena xeegiday, hinte nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristoosara issife bonchetanaasa. <verse eid="2TH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15"/>Hiza, nu ishato, minnidi eqite. Nuuni hintena nu doonan gidin woyko dabdaabiyan gidin tamaarsida timirtiya oykite.<verse eid="2TH 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16-17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16-17"/>Xoossay nu aaway nuna dosees. I nuus keeha; I merinaa minthethonne lo77o ufaysaa nuus immis. Hinte ubba wode lo77oba oothanawunne odetanaw minthethana melanne maaddana mela nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristoosanne Xoossaa nu aawa woossoos.<verse eid="2TH 2:16-17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Nuus Woossite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1"/>Wursethan nu ishato, Godaa qaalay hinte giddon ellesidi dalganaadanne bonchetanaada nuus woossite. <verse eid="2TH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2"/>Hessadaka, asi ubbay qaala si7idi ammanonna gisho, Xoossay geellatapenne iita asatape nuna ashshana mela nuus woossite.<verse eid="2TH 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3"/>Shin Goday ammanetidaysa; I hintena minthethananne Xalahepe naagana. <verse eid="2TH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4"/>Nuuni hintena kiitteysa ha77ika sinthafeka hinte oothanaysas Godan nuuni ammanetoos.<verse eid="2TH 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5"/>Goday hinte wozanaa Xoossa siiquwakonne Kiristoosa danda7aako kaaletho.<verse eid="2TH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Boozopite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6"/>Nu ishato, hinte nuupe ekida kiitaa kaallonaysatapenne ooso billiya azalla ammaniya asatape hinte shaaketanaada Godaa Yesuus Kiristoosa sunthan hintena kiittoos. <verse eid="2TH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7"/>Nuuda hanidi daanaw besseysa hinte, hinte huuphen ereeta. Nuuni hintera de7iya wode ooso billibooko. <verse eid="2TH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8"/>Nuuni oodefeka kathi mela mibooko. Nuus danda7etida mela qammanne gallas oothi daaburidi de7idape attishin, oodeska tooho gidibooko. <verse eid="2TH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9"/>Nuuni hessa oothiday, hintew leemiso gidanaasafe attishin, hintefe maade oychanaw nuus maati dhayina gidenna. <verse eid="2TH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10"/>Nu hintera de7iya wodeka, “Oothanaw koyonna asi oonika moopo” yaagidi kiitida.<verse eid="2TH 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11"/>Nuuni hessa giday, hinte giddon issi issi azallati de7eysa si7ida gishosa. He asati gelsonnaban gelidi harata ooso bilisoosonape attishin, aykoka oothokona. <verse eid="2TH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12"/>Nuuni hessa mela asati maara de7o daanadanne bantana koshshiyaba oothidi demmanaada Godaa Yesuus Kiristoosa sunthan enta kiittoosinne zoroos.<verse eid="2TH 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13"/>Shin nu ishato, lo77o ooso oothanaw azallofite. <verse eid="2TH 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14"/>Ha77i nuuni ha dabdaabiyan kiitida kiittas kiitetonna asi oonika de7iko he uraa erite. I yeellatana mela iyape shaaketite. <verse eid="2TH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15"/>Shin iya ishada seeritepe attishin, morkeda xeellofite.<verse eid="2TH 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sarotho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16"/>Saro immiya Goday, ba huuphen hintew ubba wodenne ubba baggara saro immo. Goday hinte ubbaara gido.<verse eid="2TH 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17"/>Taani Phawuloosi, ha kiitaa ta kushen xaafas. Ta kiita ubbaas mallay haysa; taani hessada xaafayis.<verse eid="2TH 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18"/>Nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristoosa aadho keehatethay hinte ubbaara gido.<verse eid="2TH 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3"/>
</usx>
